// The event table: one row per event, the single source of the Event enum, of the event -> args
// binding and of the names. Included with WXL_EVENT(name, id, args) defined by the expander.
//
// The id is the ABI: an extension built against this table subscribes by number. A row is appended
// with the next free id, never renumbered, never removed. The args struct is in wxl/Events.hpp.
